WEBVTT

00:30:28.663 --> 00:30:30.246
And I wondered if you could explain that

00:30:31.121 --> 00:30:37.079
there have been two lines of research
by Bulan Besner and by her Twigg.

00:30:38.163 --> 00:30:40.496
And asking people the same question.

00:30:41.496 --> 00:30:44.788
On two occasions or in two different
friends of mine,

00:30:45.413 --> 00:30:50.871
and it turns out that when you ask the
same question like an estimate of

00:30:51.621 --> 00:30:55.121
the number of airports,
when you ask people

00:30:55.121 --> 00:30:59.663
the same question twice separated
by some time,